<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12231" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cytae</span></b> , ārum,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κῠταία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in Colchis, the
				birthplace of Medea</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12,
				26, § 86</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cytaeaeus</span></b> , a,
				um, <i>adj., Cytæan;</i>
			<b>poet.</b> for <i>Medean</i>, i. e.
				<i>magical</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					1, 1, 24</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cy-taeus</span></b> , a,
				um, <i>adj., Cytæan;</i>
			<b>poet.</b> for <i>Colchian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terrae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Colchis</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 6, 693</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proceres,</span>”
				<i>the Colchians</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					595</span></i>
			; and <i>absol.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cytaei</span></b> ,
			ōrum, m., the same, Val. Fl.  6, 428.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cytaeis</span></b> ,
				ĭdis, f., <i>the Cytæan woman</i>, i. e. <i>Medea</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nocturna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 4, 7</span></i>
			 (17).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
